### ❓ First: Do we need to change TweakLens? Does it accept any port?

**No changes needed! TweakLens already accepts ANY port number.** 

The text box at the top is completely free-form. Whether your terminal gives you `http://localhost:54321`, `http://localhost:3001`, or `http://localhost:9999`, you can paste **any link** into the bar, click **Go**, and TweakLens will load it immediately!

